{"title":"Sunday Worship Service","startsAt":"2026-10-11T10:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-11T11:15:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Please join us for a traditional worship service every Sunday, with music from our wonderful choir and organist. Communion (the Lord’s Supper) is a part of every Sunday service. Join us for coffee hour after the service for conversation and a snack","venue":{"name":"100 Old Orchard Grove","address":"100 Old Orchard Grove, Toronto","lat":43.734287,"lng":-79.40911,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Church of St Timothy Wellness","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/9/1/1/highres_535218705.jpeg"}